# Private repo: the recovered game project, Unity working copy and playable Web build are tracked.
# Not tracked:
# - third-party tool downloads (re-downloadable, see README)
tools/
# - raw Unity/AssetRipper logs (hundreds of MB; bounded *.summary.json are kept)
reports/unity6/*.log
reports/*.log
reports/*.pid
# - verbatim copy of the Steam Windows Addressables (one bundle is 105.7 MB > GitHub's 100 MB limit;
#   the Web port rebuilds its own bundles, and the originals are in the Steam install)
**/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/
__pycache__/
